1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,590
Man: Are you doing anything this weekend, Sara?

2
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:07,950
Woman: I'm going to visit my aunt in the countryside on Saturday.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:12,370
Man: That sounds nice. How are you getting there?

4
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:16,600
Woman: By train. It takes about two hours.

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,040
Man: Will you be back on Sunday?

6
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:23,260
Woman: Yes, in the afternoon. Why?

7
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:29,180
Man: There's a concert in the park on Sunday evening. Do you want to come?

8
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:30,740
Woman: I'd love to!

